From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] propsys: text of numbers, times and vectors, byte arrays, COM check (2018)

propsys: text of numbers, times and vectors, byte arrays, COM check (2018)

From Wine's todo_wine blocks, which record Windows: PropVariantToString,
ToStringAlloc and ToBSTR write numbers, booleans, FILETIME and DATE values
(YYYY/MM/DD:HH:MM:SS.mmm) and vectors ("a; b; c"); PropVariantToBuffer
copies a VT_ARRAY|VT_UI1 array; PSRefreshPropertySchema needs COM;
VariantToPropVariant answers TYPE_E_TYPEMISMATCH for VT_ILLEGAL and
DISP_E_BADVARTYPE for VT_CLSID.
